  "description": "OEDRO Dual Convex Running Boards are custom-designed to perfectly fit the 2005-2023 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab. Featuring a robust three-tube construction, these running boards offer exceptional protection for your vehicle’s undercarriage and sides, shielding them from road debris, rocks, and other obstacles. With a sleek design and functional 6-inch drop-down side pedals, these running boards provide enhanced accessibility and a stylish upgrade for your Tacoma, especially for trucks with lift kits or oversized tires.\nFeatures\n6-Inch Side Pedals for Easy Access: The two-level step layout ensures easy entry and exit for all passengers, making it especially convenient for lifted vehicles or those with larger tires.\nThree-Tube Design for Maximum Protection: The durable three-tube construction safeguards the bottom and sides of your truck, preventing damage from obstacles and ensuring your vehicle remains adventure-ready.\nBolt-On Installation for Effortless Setup: Welded brackets and a bolt-fixed design make installation straightforward with no need for cutting or drilling. These running boards are built for both strength and simplicity.\nRugged and Weather-Resistant: Coated with a rust- and corrosion-resistant powder finish, these running boards are built to withstand harsh weather and tough road conditions, ensuring long-lasting durability.\nLaser-Cut Tread for Superior Traction: The precisely laser-cut tread surface enhances grip and prevents slipping, offering safe and secure footing in all conditions, whether it's rainy, muddy, or dry.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2005-2023 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab/Crew Cab(4-Doors Size=1:0.75).",
